    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Final verification and tracking setup:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Generate a QR‑coded slip that includes the digital audit, battery reading, fuel level, and FASTag ID. Hand this to the driver and upload it to the mover’s tracking portal. Services like IRCTC bike transport and platforms that allow you to track bike parcel in train will use this data to provide real‑time status updates, giving you confidence that the bike is in safe hands from Thane to any destination.</p>
